# The archives this repository has been pinned to, in the format `sha256sum` writes and reads, so
# that `sha256sum -c keepass.sha256` checks them too. More than one line is deliberate: going back
# to an earlier pin then needs no network and no trust decision.
#
# A new line is added by pinning a version in `keepass.version`, running `.\build.ps1 -Task KeePass`
# once to be told what arrived, and putting that here if it is what was meant.
